TITLE  Test
VERSION 170

BEGIN_GROUP TEST
    LABEL Test

    BUTTON TSG_LIBRARY
        LABEL tsg-library
        RIBBON_STYLE SMALL_IMAGE_AND_TEXT
        BITMAP ${NXCUSTOM_LIB}\toolbars\bitmaps\AssemblyExportData.bmp
